            "text": "Judge whether the inventory item is safe for the advertiser policy. Return exactly one Verdict. The action must follow severity 0 or 1 to ALLOW, 2 to REVIEW, and 3 or 4 to BLOCK. Cite only exact text spans from the item or bounding boxes within the provided media dimensions. Use only clause ids from the PolicySpec. The rationale is display-only. Do not claim synthetic-media detection accuracy.\n\nRequired item_id: x-2082551906228912361\nRequired policy_version: 1\nRequired tier: 2\nPolicySpec:\n{\"version\":1,\"advertiser\":\"Demo Travel Co.\",\"prose\":\"Do not place our ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence or promotes illegal drug sales. Allow neutral news reporting and public-health discussion of those topics. Route suspected synthetic media impersonating public officials to review.\",\"clauses\":[{\"clause_id\":\"block-graphic-violence\",\"category\":\"graphic_violence\",\"severity\":4,\"description\":\"Do not place ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence\",\"source_text\":\"Do not place our ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence or promotes illegal drug sales.\",\"source_start\":0,\"source_end\":101},{\"clause_id\":\"block-illegal-drug-sales\",\"category\":\"illegal_drug_sales\",\"severity\":4,\"description\":\"Do not place ads next to content that promotes illegal drug sales\",\"source_text\":\"Do not place our ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence or promotes illegal drug sales.\",\"source_start\":0,\"source_end\":101},{\"clause_id\":\"allow-news-public-health\",\"category\":\"news_and_public_health\",\"severity\":1,\"description\":\"Allow neutral news reporting and public-health discussion of those topics\",\"source_text\":\"Allow neutral news reporting and public-health discussion of those topics.\",\"source_start\":102,\"source_end\":176},{\"clause_id\":\"review-synthetic-media\",\"category\":\"synthetic_media\",\"severity\":2,\"description\":\"Route suspected synthetic media impersonating public officials to review\",\"source_text\":\"Route suspected synthetic media impersonating public officials to review.\",\"source_start\":177,\"source_end\":250}]}\n\nInventory text:\nThe AI Deception Machine: Deepfakes, Chatbots, and the New Frontier of Senior Fraud https://t.co/9bvwL9iJTp\n\nPrior verdict:\n{\"item_id\":\"x-2082551906228912361\",\"action\":\"ALLOW\",\"severity\":0,\"clause_ids\":[],\"evidence\":[{\"kind\":\"text\",\"quote\":\"The AI Deception Machine: Deepfakes, Chatbots, and the New Frontier of Senior Fraud\",\"start\":0,\"end\":81}],\"confidence\":0.9,\"tier\":1,\"rationale\":\"Content discusses AI deepfakes and senior fraud as a news-style topic; it does not celebrate graphic violence, promote illegal drug sales, or present suspected synthetic media impersonating public officials.\",\"policy_version\":1}\nEscalation reasons: ['low_tier_gate_failure']\nReconsider independently at high reasoning effort.",
